OL,3,GNEWSAMass clean-up after heavy rain and
OL,4,Aflooding
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommunities across Cornwall have been
OL,7,Fclearing up after heavy rain and
OL,8,Fflooding caused disruption.
OL,10,FThe Met Office had issued a yellow
OL,11,Fweather warning for heavy rain for
OL,12,FSunday. Post-storm figures showed parts
OL,13,Fof the county saw about 50mm (2in) of
OL,14,Frain over a 24-hour period - almost
OL,15,Fhalf the total expected for the whole
OL,16,Fof November.
OL,18,FGweek was completed flooded in the
OL,19,Fearly hours on Sunday, and members of
OL,20,Fthe community got together to clear
OL,21,Fdebris and unblock drains.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
